despite the turbulence,

00:52:54.199 --> 00:52:57.721
waits for his moment and to be able to unleash one of his devastating counter-attacks.

00:53:02.123 --> 00:53:02.923
That's strange, all the same.

00:53:03.563 --> 00:53:05.525
This world champion who only uses one arm.

00:53:06.125 --> 00:53:07.246
The law remains the same.

00:53:07.818 --> 00:53:08.899
While his other weapon,

00:53:09.019 --> 00:53:09.519
the left,

00:53:09.959 --> 00:53:11.820
remains mysteriously stuck to the body.

00:53:14.182 --> 00:53:15.182
La mota understood.

00:53:15.883 --> 00:53:17.724
His injured opponent became one-armed.

00:53:18.584 --> 00:53:19.065
confident.

00:53:19.805 --> 00:53:22.307
Now it is he who waits and seeks the fatal blow.

00:53:23.187 --> 00:53:25.889
While Marcel continues to move forward with the energy of despair,

00:53:26.209 --> 00:53:29.071
taking the hit and ready to die rather than surrender.

00:53:31.992 --> 00:53:34.774
We had never seen Marcel used as a sandbag before.

00:53:35.173 --> 00:53:37.015
A bull turned bullfighter

00:53:37.456 --> 00:53:40.418
advancing with his arms dangling, so certain was he of the kill.

00:53:45.322 --> 00:53:46.843
Marcel has been dying for 20 minutes.

00:53:47.523 --> 00:53:51.286
The bull needs to breathe, so now he's playing cat and mouse.

00:53:57.570 --> 00:53:59.412
World champion for barely 9 months,

00:54:00.153 --> 00:54:01.974
and Marcel became a shadow of his former self.

00:54:02.637 --> 00:54:05.038
Left to be exploited by a hateful man,

00:54:05.818 --> 00:54:07.320
A sad end to the finals.

00:54:08.099 --> 00:54:10.501
interrupted by the bell at the end of the ninth round.

00:54:11.822 --> 00:54:12.221
This time,

00:54:13.003 --> 00:54:15.983
It is Marcel's turn to not answer the call for the next round.

00:54:16.983 --> 00:54:17.864
as she had done,

00:54:18.364 --> 00:54:19.065
nine months earlier,

00:54:19.125 --> 00:54:21.105
as Jack Lamotta might do one day.

00:54:22.507 --> 00:54:24.887
Boxing is like a limpet that never lets go of its prey.

00:54:25.447 --> 00:54:28.288
whether in the shadow of a ring or in the glare of victory.

00:54:31.818 --> 00:54:33.659
Even if a son wouldn't believe it.

00:54:34.820 --> 00:54:35.261
My father,

00:54:35.521 --> 00:54:37.342
He is preparing for his fight against Jacques Lamotta.

00:54:38.543 --> 00:54:39.384
He's in the locker room.

00:54:40.104 --> 00:54:43.367
He's in the locker room and we're moving the fight forward by half an hour.

00:54:43.687 --> 00:54:45.969
We catch him cold and he enters the ring cold.

00:54:46.129 --> 00:54:46.710
He slips.

00:54:47.010 --> 00:54:48.091
He was never knocked out.

00:54:48.411 --> 00:54:49.011
He never...

00:54:49.392 --> 00:54:50.773
He slipped and fell.

00:54:51.533 --> 00:54:52.394
And he puts his shoulder down.

00:54:54.155 --> 00:54:55.476
Not the right shoulder, unfortunately.

00:54:55.556 --> 00:54:56.257
the left shoulder.

00:54:56.537 --> 00:54:57.278
The shoulder where there is...

00:54:57.577 --> 00:54:59.239
where we protect ourselves and where he can strike.

00:54:59.579 --> 00:54:59.978
The right wing,

00:54:59.999 --> 00:55:00.480
He has it like that,

00:55:00.840 --> 00:55:01.119
the blows,

00:55:01.121 --> 00:55:01.559
You take it.

00:55:01.599 --> 00:55:05.402
August 49.

00:55:06.262 --> 00:55:06.722
New York.

00:55:07.342 --> 00:55:09.565
The rematch was finally scheduled for the end of September.

00:55:10.385 --> 00:55:11.706
Five weeks to prepare.

00:55:12.186 --> 00:55:13.887
Especially before the final stretch.

00:55:14.347 --> 00:55:16.228
to spend a little more quality time with Edith,

00:55:16.688 --> 00:55:17.829
in the New York apartment.

00:55:18.469 --> 00:55:19.050
Even though Piaf,

00:55:19.150 --> 00:55:20.731
always hidden from the cameras,

00:55:21.311 --> 00:55:22.130
appears absent.

00:55:23.092 --> 00:55:24.492
Everyone ends up in Manhattan.

00:55:25.173 --> 00:55:25.793
Loulou Barrier,

00:55:25.833 --> 00:55:26.954
the little girl's manager.

00:55:27.465 --> 00:55:29.648
The sycophantic longman behind his dark glasses,

00:55:30.168 --> 00:55:30.889
Paul Janser,

00:55:30.969 --> 00:55:31.730
the close friend, confidant

00:55:32.371 --> 00:55:35.353
In his own way, a more Hollywood-esque servant than ever before,

00:55:35.974 --> 00:55:39.237
on which and under which Piaf finally handed over notes and handcuffs.

00:55:44.864 --> 00:55:47.367
Let's not forget the ultimate reason for this trip,

00:55:48.086 --> 00:55:50.228
the match against that old rogue from La Mota.

00:55:50.789 --> 00:55:53.336
who submits without any problem to the pre-fight medical examination,

00:55:53.838 --> 00:55:54.960
mandatory in the USA.

00:55:55.603 --> 00:55:56.304
In any case,

00:55:56.344 --> 00:55:57.447
for what an oath is worth,

00:55:58.170 --> 00:55:59.072
Was it Hippocratic?

00:56:02.045 --> 00:56:06.989
My father was in New York for the rematch and Graziano,

00:56:07.248 --> 00:56:08.048
OK Graziano,

00:56:08.429 --> 00:56:11.351
He went to see my father at training.

00:56:13.511 --> 00:56:14.132
Training,

00:56:14.134 --> 00:56:15.313
He went to work for Jacques Lamotta.

00:56:15.574 --> 00:56:16.213
He said Jacques,

00:56:16.214 --> 00:56:16.713
He is Italian.

00:56:17.014 --> 00:56:17.534
two Italians,

00:56:17.554 --> 00:56:18.255
Graziano and Lamotta.

00:56:18.855 --> 00:56:19.675
He said Jacques,

00:56:20.016 --> 00:56:20.817
Don't take it.

00:56:21.056 --> 00:56:22.217
He's going to kill you.

00:56:23.217 --> 00:56:24.057
Don't take it.

00:56:27.239 --> 00:56:29.741
Message received loud and clear, or real injury.

00:56:30.505 --> 00:56:30.846
In any case,

00:56:30.846 --> 00:56:33.586
The Bronx bull withdraws four days before the fight.

00:56:33.907 --> 00:56:37.867
preferring to play the lamb with his son rather than the tough guy with Marcel.

00:56:43.150 --> 00:56:46.690
Eighth return to the eternal constellation that allows us to see America so well.

00:56:47.710 --> 00:56:48.891
You can find everything down there,

00:56:49.530 --> 00:56:50.211
except for Morocco.

00:56:51.291 --> 00:56:52.692
And you can find everything at the little one's place.

00:56:53.152 --> 00:56:54.992
except for one family and their relatives.

00:56:55.833 --> 00:56:56.132
This time,

00:56:56.172 --> 00:56:57.273
despite Edith's pleas,

00:56:57.293 --> 00:56:58.293
who always wants more,

00:56:58.954 --> 00:57:00.395
Marcel flies to France.

00:57:02.097 --> 00:57:03.098
When he lands at Orly,

00:57:03.198 --> 00:57:05.259
The man who always laughed no longer smiles.

00:57:06.020 --> 00:57:08.042
As for his comments about the motorcyclist's evasive maneuver,

00:57:08.322 --> 00:57:09.883
They are surely appropriate for the circumstances.

00:57:10.484 --> 00:57:10.764
Quickly,

00:57:11.425 --> 00:57:11.965
Morocco.

00:57:13.317 --> 00:57:14.219
Find Marinette,

00:57:14.759 --> 00:57:15.259
the children,

00:57:15.299 --> 00:57:15.940
his relatives,

00:57:16.560 --> 00:57:19.663
In short, the family, who are not afraid to speak their minds about this Mediterranean double,

00:57:20.023 --> 00:57:22.445
Spanish by origin and Moroccan by adoption.

00:57:23.726 --> 00:57:24.646
Three sons now,

00:57:24.906 --> 00:57:25.567
and their friends,

00:57:26.308 --> 00:57:30.431
not to mention his beloved farm in Sidi Marouf and his pigs which amuse him.

00:57:34.194 --> 00:57:37.317
It's true that it still looks dilapidated with all its hectares lying fallow.

00:57:38.025 --> 00:57:39.706
But everything remains to be done since it is here,

00:57:39.766 --> 00:57:40.226
in Morocco,

00:57:40.567 --> 00:57:41.226
that he wants to live,

00:57:41.607 --> 00:57:42.307
and also over there,

00:57:42.327 --> 00:57:42.728
in the city,

00:57:42.887 --> 00:57:43.909
where his brewery awaits him,

00:57:44.389 --> 00:57:46.969
and the new house whose foundation stone he has just laid.

00:57:47.650 --> 00:57:47.951
Gaza,

00:57:48.150 --> 00:57:50.132
towards which he is now heading,

00:57:50.771 --> 00:57:51.931
in this October rain.

00:57:52.712 --> 00:57:53.913
And still these two worlds,

00:57:54.252 --> 00:57:54.534
Anne,

00:57:55.313 --> 00:57:55.634
Plane,

00:57:56.534 --> 00:57:59.295
to find his way back to the city where all his memories are,

00:57:59.596 --> 00:58:03.277
and where nothing seems to have really changed since the 1920s.

00:58:05.458 --> 00:58:10.539
Except perhaps for a baseball cap replacing a shaved head and the colors of a short film shot with friends,

00:58:10.860 --> 00:58:13.280
to which Marcel serves as driver and guide.

00:58:16.481 --> 00:58:17.301
October 26,

00:58:17.942 --> 00:58:18.262
Paris,

00:58:18.961 --> 00:58:19.082
D-2.

00:58:20.242 --> 00:58:20.922
For the past few days,

00:58:20.942 --> 00:58:24.383
Marcel knows that the rematch against Mota has been set for December 2nd.

00:58:25.244 --> 00:58:25.584
Tomorrow,

00:58:25.644 --> 00:58:26.964
He has to leave for the USA.

00:58:27.884 --> 00:58:28.625
Always helpful,

00:58:28.626 --> 00:58:31.746
He nevertheless agreed to participate in an exhibition match in Troyes.

00:58:32.246 --> 00:58:33.146
to please a friend.

00:58:33.545 --> 00:58:35.406
even if it means having to return to Paris in the middle of the night.

00:58:36.507 --> 00:58:39.190
My father returns to Paris in the evening.

00:58:40.670 --> 00:58:41.371
In the car,

00:58:41.791 --> 00:58:42.511
There are four of them.

00:58:44.472 --> 00:58:45.054
And all of a sudden,

00:58:45.054 --> 00:58:47.534
One of them said to my father,

00:58:47.576 --> 00:58:48.815
My father was in the process of fussing,

00:58:51.958 --> 00:58:52.679
He told my father,

00:58:52.759 --> 00:58:53.799
Why are you leaving now?

00:58:53.880 --> 00:58:54.759
Why are you leaving now?

00:58:54.779 --> 00:58:55.740
You have time to leave.

00:58:56.641 --> 00:58:57.121
So, my father,

00:58:57.141 --> 00:58:57.862
he said,

00:58:57.882 --> 00:58:58.362
Turn on the radio.

00:58:58.583 --> 00:59:00.183
He turns on the radio and it's Pierre Fkishon.

00:59:00.243 --> 00:59:00.463
He said,

00:59:00.464 --> 00:59:01.444
Well, that's why I'm leaving.

00:59:01.525 --> 00:59:01.884
for her,

00:59:02.425 --> 00:59:03.085
to join her.

00:59:03.690 --> 00:59:04.550
Because she had written,

00:59:04.552 --> 00:59:04.971
she had told him,

00:59:04.990 --> 00:59:05.171
There,

00:59:05.271 --> 00:59:06.452
I have a few days of vacation.

00:59:06.892 --> 00:59:07.832
instead of taking your boat,

00:59:07.972 --> 00:59:08.233
come,

00:59:08.233 --> 00:59:10.934
That way we can spend a few days together before your world championship.

00:59:11.134 --> 00:59:11.294
So,

00:59:11.355 --> 00:59:11.875
It was simple.

00:59:13.655 --> 00:59:14.416
October 27,

00:59:14.476 --> 00:59:14.596
D-1.

00:59:15.416 --> 00:59:17.057
Marcel leaves Langman's apartment.

00:59:18.519 --> 00:59:18.878
At Orly,

00:59:18.919 --> 00:59:20.680
He poses one last time with Ginette Neveu.

00:59:21.079 --> 00:59:22.441
young virtuoso violinist.

00:59:22.701 --> 00:59:23.981
She hands him her Stradivarius.

00:59:24.242 --> 00:59:25.803
musical instrument par excellence.

00:59:27.804 --> 00:59:29.565
Although Edith knew nothing about boxing,

00:59:30.445 --> 00:59:30.966
On the other hand...

00:59:31.642 --> 00:59:33.663
As for life and its symbols,

01:00:03.662 --> 01:00:04.082
It is 2:55 AM

01:00:04.762 --> 01:00:07.123
GMT, this 28th of October 1949,

01:00:07.183 --> 01:00:08.784
when Cerdan's plane stopped responding,

01:00:09.484 --> 01:00:12.805
and will never again respond to the control tower of the Azores island.

01:00:15.746 --> 01:00:16.186
On the ground,

01:00:16.206 --> 01:00:17.526
an inextricable charnel house

01:00:17.926 --> 01:00:18.907
and 48 corpses.

01:00:19.567 --> 01:00:24.488
Marcel's watch was identified thanks to one of the three watches that this champion of all worlds always wore.

01:00:24.848 --> 01:00:26.449
each at their respective Paris time,

01:00:26.829 --> 01:00:28.190
New York and Casablanca.

01:00:30.242 --> 01:00:32.525
When the Liberator brings Marcel's body home,

01:00:32.585 --> 01:00:33.046
They are here.

01:00:33.166 --> 01:00:33.687
his brothers.

01:00:34.288 --> 01:00:35.610
They too were former boxers.

01:00:35.890 --> 01:00:36.812
at the head of the procession.

01:00:37.653 --> 01:00:38.254
And then there are the women,

01:00:38.274 --> 01:00:38.694
Of course,

01:00:38.774 --> 01:00:40.076
but as it should be, behind.

01:00:40.477 --> 01:00:40.958
All knocked out.

01:00:41.759 --> 01:00:43.581
Facing this champion who was never considered out.

01:00:44.463 --> 01:00:45.724
Except by fate.

01:00:50.641 --> 01:00:51.302
Along the route,

01:00:51.322 --> 01:00:54.804
70,000 people watched him cross these cities one last time.

01:00:55.264 --> 01:00:59.606
escorted by two young champions carrying relics of years born barely 33 years old.

01:01:00.307 --> 01:01:02.608
To the sound of the church bells of Our Lady of Lourdes,

01:01:03.188 --> 01:01:04.750
and above the Msyk cemetery,

01:01:05.411 --> 01:01:07.471
two names resonating in European and Arabic languages.

01:01:08.132 --> 01:01:09.853
like many of those present that day,

01:01:10.413 --> 01:01:12.715
not to mention a certain Don Quixote from the Rignes area,

01:01:13.255 --> 01:01:14.976
returned to greet his former protégé and friend,

01:01:15.735 --> 01:01:17.978
before he was buried in his Moroccan soil.

01:01:22.101 --> 01:01:23.103
At Paris-Au-Vel-Divre,

01:01:24.223 --> 01:01:27.005
Six former world champions have left one place empty among them.

01:01:28.047 --> 01:01:29.248
that of their former companions.

01:01:30.308 --> 01:01:33.871
He was also greeted by tens of thousands of people in stadiums across France.

01:01:34.833 --> 01:01:39.777
honoring the memory of a deceased champion who will not see this new world of the 1950s,

01:01:40.516 --> 01:01:42.598
to which he had helped to give its full impetus.

01:01:44.219 --> 01:01:45.681
People are struck by death.

01:01:46.621 --> 01:01:47.143
We're counting down,

01:01:47.163 --> 01:01:48.244
that's because of Romeo and Juliet,

01:01:48.284 --> 01:01:50.125
They join Piaf and they die.

01:01:53.963 --> 01:01:54.083
That,

01:01:54.124 --> 01:01:55.695
It always remains etched in someone's mind.

01:01:58.123 --> 01:01:59.203
In 1960,

01:01:59.283 --> 01:02:01.244
Piaf is 45 years old and remembers.

01:02:01.884 --> 01:02:02.184
Whose?

01:02:03.104 --> 01:02:04.085
She's had so many men,

01:02:04.605 --> 01:02:05.165
while he,

01:02:05.305 --> 01:02:05.685
Cerdan,

01:02:05.765 --> 01:02:06.805
dissolved underground.

01:02:08.246 --> 01:02:08.706
But deep down,

01:02:08.726 --> 01:02:09.346
never mind.

01:02:10.006 --> 01:02:13.027
It is enough to know that a great champion never belongs to himself body and soul.

01:02:14.147 --> 01:02:16.748
So many people want to have it and see it.

01:02:17.648 --> 01:02:19.449
Where he himself could never be.

01:02:20.389 --> 01:02:22.230
That is what makes it both ridiculous and glorious.

01:02:23.670 --> 01:02:24.010
Otherwise,

01:02:24.050 --> 01:02:26.931
It's like the son who would have aged him and never grown up.

01:02:27.731 --> 01:02:28.552
Marcel Cerdan,

01:02:29.253 --> 01:02:30.514
a French legend.

01:03:18.788 --> 01:03:18.948
1,

01:03:19.008 --> 01:03:19.288
2,

01:03:19.488 --> 01:03:23.909
3,

01:03:40.354 --> 01:03:41.175
2

